      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "PokemonObjects.cs reads Pokemon.CS and makes a list of Pokemon with all attributes attached.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "PokemonObjects.cs reads Pokemon.CS and makes a list of Pokemon with all attributes attached.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "WKANmxO6CECPPo5XFXGJz",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2588.224257327296,
      "y": -300.49167124090127,
      "width": 1265,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aC",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1842086717,
      "version": 527,
      "versionNonce": 152417476,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788454228598,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "If the user chooses to want to sort the top 10 attributes list after the main type of a pokemon, I need\nto get a new list that updates after the answer he gives and sorts the new list with only those\nattributes. Maybe a list that can just select for example main type grass and make a new list???\n\nKanskje i en LinQ?",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "If the user chooses to want to sort the top 10 attributes list after the main type of a pokemon, I need to get a new list that updates after the answer he gives and sorts the new list with only those attributes. Maybe a list that can just select for example main type grass and make a new list???\n\nKanskje i en LinQ?",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "WKJBHhrR3Vl4JxT6iOCp5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2553.724257327296,
      "y": -34.99167124090127,
      "width": 1376.5,
      "height": 70,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aD",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 917182205,
      "version": 326,
      "versionNonce": 65005948,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788454228598,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Kanskje først spørre bruker om type, og så filtrere ut alle pokemons i den typen, og så spørre bruker hvilke\ntop 10 lister hen vil ha, og så filtrere ut top 10 liste av feks HP i type Dark. ",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Kanskje først spørre bruker om type, og så filtrere ut alle pokemons i den typen, og så spørre bruker hvilke top 10 lister hen vil ha, og så filtrere ut top 10 liste av feks HP i type Dark. ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
